-- Lesson 1: Hello in Oromo!
UPDATE public.lessons SET content = $CONTENT$## Say Hello!

In Oromo, we say **Akkam!** (Hello!) 👋

| Oromo | English |
|-------|---------|
| Akkam! | Hello! |
| Nagaa | Peace / hi |
| Akkam jirta? | How are you? |
| Ani nagaa | I am fine |
| Maqaan kee eenyu? | What is your name? |
| Maqaan koo... | My name is... |

## Try It!

**Friend:** Akkam!
**You:** Akkam! Ani nagaa. Maqaan koo Amir. 😊

## Fun Fact

Oromo children greet elders by bowing slightly and saying *Akkam jirtu?* (formal "how are you?"). It shows respect.

**Today you learned:** How to say hello and share your name in Afaan Oromoo!
$CONTENT$
