-- Lesson 2: Colors (Halluu)
UPDATE public.lessons SET content = $CONTENT$## Colors! 🎨

Look around — the world is full of colors! In Oromo, color is **halluu**.

| Halluu | Color |
|--------|-------|
| diimaa | red |
| magariisa | green |
| cuquliisa | blue |
| keelloo | yellow |
| gurraacha | black |
| adii | white |
| makoo | brown |

## Color + Noun

To say "red apple" in Oromo, put the color AFTER the noun:
- poomii diimaa = red apple 🍎
- bishaan cuquliisa = blue water 💧

## Game!

Point to something and say its color in Oromo. Can you find:
- something **diimaa**? ❤️
- something **keelloo**? 🌟
- something **gurraacha**? ⚫

**Today you learned:** 7 colors in Afaan Oromoo! Great job. 👏
$CONTENT$
