-- Lesson 4: Animals (Bineensa)
UPDATE public.lessons SET content = $CONTENT$## Meet the Animals! 🐾

Animals in Oromo are called **bineensa**. Let's learn their names.

| Oromo | Animal |
|-------|--------|
| saree | dog 🐕 |
| adurree | cat 🐈 |
| sangaa | ox |
| re'ee | goat 🐐 |
| hoolaa | sheep 🐑 |
| farda | horse 🐴 |
| indaaqqoo | chicken 🐔 |
| simbirra | bird 🐦 |
| qurxummii | fish 🐟 |

## Farm or Wild?

Farm animals (*horii manaa*): saree, adurree, hoolaa, farda
Wild animals (*bineensa bosonaa*): leenca (lion), arba (elephant), qeerransa (leopard)

## Make the Sound!

- saree → "woof woof"
- adurree → "meow"
- indaaqqoo → "cock-a-doodle-doo"

**Today you learned:** 9 animals in Afaan Oromoo! 🎉
$CONTENT$
