-- Lesson 5: My Family (Maatii Koo)
UPDATE public.lessons SET content = $CONTENT$## My Family! 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦

Family is **maatii** in Oromo. Family is the most important thing in Oromo life!

| Oromo | Family Member |
|-------|---------------|
| abbaa | father |
| haadha | mother |
| obboleessa | brother |
| obboleettii | sister |
| akaakayyuu | grandfather |
| akaakayyoo | grandmother |
| wasiila | cousin |
| adaadaa | paternal aunt |

## Talk About Your Family

- Abbaan koo... (My father is...)
- Haadhi koo... (My mother is...)
- Obboleessi koo lama. (I have two brothers.)

## Respect Your Elders

Oromo children always greet elders first and listen when they speak. This is called **kabajaa** — respect.

**Today you learned:** Words for family in Afaan Oromoo! ❤️
