-- Lesson 6: Food I Love
UPDATE public.lessons SET content = $CONTENT$## Yummy Food! 🍲

Food is **nyaata** in Oromo. Let's learn about tasty Oromo foods!

| Oromo | Food |
|-------|------|
| buddeena | injera (flatbread) |
| chechebsa | traditional breakfast |
| aannan | milk 🥛 |
| bishaan | water 💧 |
| buna | coffee ☕ |
| shaayii | tea 🍵 |
| muuza | banana 🍌 |
| poomii | apple 🍎 |

## Yum or Yuck?

- **Ani buddeena jaalladha.** (I love injera.) 😋
- **Ani shaayii barbaada.** (I want tea.) 🍵

## Oromo Coffee Fun Fact

Coffee (**buna**) was first discovered in Kaffa, the land of the Oromo! That's where your coffee comes from! ☕

**Today you learned:** Food words in Afaan Oromoo! 🍓
