-- Lesson 7: Songs and Rhymes
UPDATE public.lessons SET content = $CONTENT$## Let's Sing! 🎶

Oromo children love to sing songs called **weedduu**. Songs help us learn words fast!

## Clap and Count

| Oromo | Action |
|-------|--------|
| rukutaa | clap |
| utaaluu | jump |
| fiiguu | run |
| taphachuu | play |

## A Simple Rhyme

**Tokko, lama, sadii — ani nyaata barbaada!** 🎵
(One, two, three — I want food!)

**Diimaa, adii, cuquliisa — halluun hedduu jira!** 🎨
(Red, white, blue — there are many colors!)

## Action Time!

- **Rukutaa!** — Clap your hands! 👏
- **Utaaluu!** — Jump up! ⬆️
- **Taphachuu!** — Let's play! 🎈

**Today you learned:** Fun action words and a simple Oromo rhyme. 🎉
$CONTENT$
